[TITLE]
BND-13: a CUSTOM inlet with a RATING curve (capture vs depth) and a capture
limit Qmax = 0.5 cfs in [INLET_USAGE]. The street carries 3 cfs; the rating
curve would capture about 2 cfs at the street depth.

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS CFS
FLOW_ROUTING DYNWAVE
LINK_OFFSETS DEPTH
START_DATE 07/27/2020
START_TIME 00:00:00
END_DATE 07/27/2020
END_TIME 03:00:00
REPORT_STEP 00:15:00
WET_STEP 00:05:00
DRY_STEP 01:00:00
ROUTING_STEP 0:00:10

[JUNCTIONS]
;;Name  Elev  MaxDepth  InitDepth  SurDepth  Aponded
U       100   0         0          0         0
B        96   0         0          0         0
C         2   0         0          0         0

[OUTFALLS]
O       92    FREE NO
X        0    FREE NO

[CONDUITS]
;;Name  From  To  Length  N      InOff  OutOff  InitQ  MaxQ
S1      U     B   400     0.016  0      0       0      0
S2      B     O   400     0.016  0      0       0      0
P       C     X   400     0.01   0      0       0      0

[XSECTIONS]
S1  STREET    Street2  0  0  0  1
S2  STREET    Street2  0  0  0  1
P   CIRCULAR  2        0  0  0  1

[STREETS]
;;Name   Tcrown  Hcurb  Sx  nRoad  a      W  Sides
Street2  20      0.5    2   0.016  .0833  2  1

[INLETS]
;;Name  Type    Curve
Cust    CUSTOM  CapCurve

[INLET_USAGE]
;;Link  Inlet  CaptureNode  #Inlets  %Clog  Qmax
S1      Cust   C            1        0      0.5

[CURVES]
;;Name    Type    Depth(ft)  Capture(cfs)
CapCurve  Rating  0          0
CapCurve          0.5        5
CapCurve          2          20

[INFLOWS]
;;Node  Param  TSeries  Type  Mfactor  Sfactor  Baseline
U       FLOW   ""       FLOW  1.0      1.0      3.0

[REPORT]
INPUT NO
NODES ALL
LINKS ALL
